#. module: bf_outreach
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_outreach.bf_onb_step_campaign
msgid ""
"[action:bf_outreach.action_bf_outreach_campaign] Définissez la période, "
"l'équipe et la cadence de relance (combien d'appels et de courriels, à quel "
"intervalle)."
msgstr ""
"[action:bf_outreach.action_bf_outreach_campaign] Set the period, the team "
"and the follow-up cadence (how many calls and emails, at what interval)."

#. module: bf_outreach
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_outreach.bf_onb_step_targets
msgid ""
"[action:bf_outreach.action_bf_outreach_target] Ajoutez les cibles depuis vos"
" contacts, ou sélectionnez-les dans la liste des contacts et utilisez "
"l'action « Ajouter à une campagne de démarchage »."
msgstr ""
"[action:bf_outreach.action_bf_outreach_target] Add the targets from your "
"contacts, or select them in the contact list and use the “Add to an outreach"
" campaign” action."

#. module: bf_outreach
#: model:onboarding.onboarding.step,description:bf_outreach.bf_onb_step_touches
msgid ""
"[action:bf_outreach.action_bf_outreach_touch] Chaque appel et chaque "
"courriel se note en deux clics ; les prochaines relances se calculent "
"seules."
msgstr ""
"[action:bf_outreach.action_bf_outreach_touch] Every call and every email "
"takes two clicks to note; the next follow-ups work themselves out."

